          "option_value": "broken",
          "deduction_type": "fixed",
          "deduction_value": 0,
          "is_disqualifying": true,
          "disqualify_status": "manual_review"
        }
      ],
      "note": "'Broken' covers too wide a range (hairline crack vs. shattered vs. non-original replacement screen) for a single fixed deduction \u2014 routed to manual review."
